Operative '''Verona Gillian''' is a [[human]] [[quest giver]] located at [[SI:7 Outpost]] in [[Balor]].

==Quests==
* {{questlong|Alliance|28|My Darling Wife}} {{questfinish}}
* {{questlong|Alliance|34|Into The Tortured Past}} {{questfinish}}
* {{questlong|Alliance|27|Assessing The Situation}} {{queststart}}
* {{questlong|Alliance|30+|To The Darkest Places}} {{questfinish}}
* {{questlong|Alliance|30|Noppsy Spickerspan (quest)|Noppsy Spickerspan}} {{queststart}}
* {{questlong|Alliance|32|Harrowing News}} {{questfinish}}
* {{questlong|Alliance|33+|Into The Hornet's Nest}} {{queststartfinish}}
* {{questlong|Alliance|38D|Heart of Darkness}} {{queststartfinish}}

==Quotes==
;Gossip
For me, Balor was nothing more than a mare my parents used to jokingly scare me with; to prepare me for the dangers outside of Stormwind. I even continued telling the same terrifying fairy tales to my children, much to the dismay of my husband. Now that I am here, I wish those stories were reality.

